<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Scholarship Application Packet</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .header-logo {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .header-logo img {
    max-width: 200px;
  }
  .title-section {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .title-section h1 {
    font-size: 36pt;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .title-section h2 {
    font-size: 24pt;
    margin-top: 0;
    border-top: 2px solid #000;
    padding-top: 10px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 16pt;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .footer-note {
    font-size: 10pt;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 18pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .content-block {
    font-size: 11pt;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .list-item {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .form-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-row label {
    width: 150px;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .form-row input[type="text"], .form-row input[type="date"] {
    flex-grow: 1;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 2px 5px;
  }
  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 11pt;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    padding-bottom: 5px;
    width: 40%;
  }
  .table-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 5px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
  }
  .table-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 5px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">Cleveland State University</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">engagedlearning</div>
  </div>

  <div class="title-section">
    <h1>Sullivan-Deckard Scholars</h1>
    <h2>Opportunity Program</h2>
    <div class="subtitle">2018-2019 Application Packet</div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note">
    Please return completed and signed application form to Dr. <span data-field="contact_person_name">{{ contact_person_name }}</span>, Office of Inclusion and Multicultural Engagement, Cleveland State University, <span data-field="university_address">{{ university_address }}</span>, Cleveland, Ohio <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span> by <span data-field="submission_deadline">{{ submission_deadline }}</span> PM on or before <span data-field="submission_date">{{ submission_date }}</span>. For additional information, email Dr. <span data-field="contact_person_email">{{ contact_person_email }}</span> or telephone – <span data-field="contact_phone">{{ contact_phone }}</span>.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">Cleveland State University</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">engagedlearning</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program and Scholarship Overview</div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p>The Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program provides an opportunity for youth who have experienced foster care to pursue an undergraduate degree. The Program promotes academic success and degree completion through a continuous system of support and resources. Scholars receive professional guidance, educational support, and peer mentoring as important components of the program structure. The goal is to assure successful planning and preparation for college, followed by structured academic coaching to make a smooth transition to university life and academic success.</p>
    <p>Applications for <span data-field="application_year">{{ application_year }}</span> program activities will be accepted until <span data-field="application_deadline_date">{{ application_deadline_date }}</span>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Program Overview</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>The program is customized to address the complicated needs for economic security, academic coaching and emotional support required for youth aging out of foster care with a comprehensive system of support. Participation in the CSU Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program offers the benefit of a world-class education with greater economic stability, personal and professional development, and skills that contribute to academic success and degree completion.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Program Features</div>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
    <li class="list-item"><span data-field="feature_1">{{ feature_1 }}</span></li>
    <li class="list-item"><span data-field="feature_2">{{ feature_2 }}</span></li>
    <li class="list-item"><span data-field="feature_3">{{ feature_3 }}</span></li>
    <li class="list-item"><span data-field="feature_4">{{ feature_4 }}</span></li>
    <li class="list-item"><span data-field="feature_5">{{ feature_5 }}</span></li>
    <li class="list-item"><span data-field="feature_6">{{ feature_6 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">Eligibility to apply for the program and scholarship</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>Participation in the Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program is voluntary.</p>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="eligibility_1">{{ eligibility_1 }}</span></li>
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="eligibility_2">{{ eligibility_2 }}</span></li>
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="eligibility_3">{{ eligibility_3 }}</span></li>
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="eligibility_4">{{ eligibility_4 }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Peer Assistance</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>Recipients of the CSU Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program Scholarship will be matched with CSU students who will serve as peer assistants, offering encouragement and support for a smooth transition and academic success. In addition, a small group of volunteer Professional Mentors will support students as they transition to university life and persist to degree completion.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Program Oversight</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>The Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program is administered by the CSU Office of Inclusion and Multicultural Engagement – Division of University Engagement.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">Cleveland State University</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">engagedlearning</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program Scholarship Selection Process</div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p>Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program On-line application for <span data-field="application_year_2">{{ application_year_2 }}</span> is now available on the CSU Website. Applicants must apply for admission and already be admitted to Cleveland State University. Program applications must be received no later than <span data-field="application_deadline_date_2">{{ application_deadline_date_2 }}</span>.</p>
    <p>Applications for participation in the Sullivan-Deckard Scholarship Program will be reviewed by a selection committee that includes CSU staff, faculty and community collaborators convened by the Coordinator, Inclusion and Multicultural Engagement. The process will follow these steps:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>Applicants must submit completed Program Scholarship application for participation in the Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program by the cut-off date – <span data-field="application_deadline_date_3">{{ application_deadline_date_3 }}</span>. Completed application packet must include:
        <ul>
          <li>A completed application form and supporting documentation including transcript and ACT scores</li>
          <li>A personal interest essay (up to 1000 words)</li>
          <li>Two written recommendations in support for applicant's participation and scholarship award.</li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li>Finalists must successfully complete an in-person interview conducted by a panel of interviewers selected by the Coordinator, Inclusion and Multicultural Engagement. Interviews will be conducted in <span data-field="interview_month">{{ interview_month }}</span> <span data-field="interview_year">{{ interview_year }}</span> for summer <span data-field="application_year_3">{{ application_year_3 }}</span> enrollment.</li>
      <li>Up to <span data-field="number_of_slots">{{ number_of_slots }}</span> students will be selected to receive a Sullivan-Deckard Scholarship to attend CSU beginning in the summer <span data-field="application_year_4">{{ application_year_4 }}</span> session. Final selection of program participants will reflect a strong, mature, and diverse cohort of participants.</li>
      <li>Scholarship recipients automatically become part of the Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program and will be required to comply with all eligibility requirements. Program participants will be required to attend various "on-campus" events and activities, receive guidance, and make a successful transition to college life.</li>
      <li>The scholarship is renewable each semester provided that the Scholar remains in good academic standing, is in full compliance with the Student Conduct Code, and successfully completes assigned projects, coursework and degree requirements.</li>
      <li>Grades and participation in Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program activities, along with overall academic performance, will be reviewed regularly throughout each semester, at the mid-term, and at the conclusion of every semester. Scholars must meet these conditions and the University's standards for academic progress and behavior, including but not limited to the CSU Student Conduct Code, CSU harassment, discrimination and Title IX policies. The scholarship may be renewed at the end of each semester.</li>
    </ol>
    <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>Please return completed and signed application form, essay, letters of support, and recommendation forms to Dr. <span data-field="contact_person_name_2">{{ contact_person_name_2 }}</span>, Office of Inclusion and Multicultural Engagement, Cleveland State University, <span data-field="university_address_2">{{ university_address_2 }}</span>, Cleveland, Ohio <span data-field="zip_code_2">{{ zip_code_2 }}</span> by <span data-field="submission_deadline_2">{{ submission_deadline_2 }}</span> PM on or before <span data-field="submission_date_2">{{ submission_date_2 }}</span>. For additional information, email Dr. <span data-field="contact_person_email_2">{{ contact_person_email_2 }}</span> or telephone – <span data-field="contact_phone_2">{{ contact_phone_2 }}</span>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">Cleveland State University</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">engagedlearning</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program Scholarship Requirements</div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p>By accepting the Sullivan-Deckard Scholarship, applicants understand that in addition to all rules and expectations that apply to Cleveland State University students, recipients must also adhere to the following in order to remain eligible to receive the Sullivan-Deckard Scholarship.</p>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="req_1">{{ req_1 }}</span></li>
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="req_2">{{ req_2 }}</span></li>
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="req_3">{{ req_3 }}</span></li>
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="req_4">{{ req_4 }}</span></li>
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="req_5">{{ req_5 }}</span></li>
      <li class="list-item"><span data-field="req_6">{{ req_6 }}</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">Cleveland State University</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">engagedlearning</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program Scholarship Application</div>

  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Last Name:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.last_name" value="{{ applicant.last_name }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>First Name:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.first_name" value="{{ applicant.first_name }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Local Address:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.address" value="{{ applicant.address }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>City:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.city" value="{{ applicant.city }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Number, street, apartment:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.street_number" value="{{ applicant.street_number }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Zip Code:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.zip_code" value="{{ applicant.zip_code }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Email:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.email" value="{{ applicant.email }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Cell Phone:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.phone" value="{{ applicant.phone }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Place of Birth:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.dob_place" value="{{ applicant.dob_place }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Date of Birth:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="applicant.dob_date" value="{{ applicant.dob_date }}">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Academic information</div>
  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>School you are attending now:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="academic.current_school" value="{{ academic.current_school }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Current Grade:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="academic.current_grade" value="{{ academic.current_grade }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Expected Graduation Date:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="academic.expected_graduation_date" value="{{ academic.expected_graduation_date }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Grade Point Average (GPA):</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="academic.gpa" value="{{ academic.gpa }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Community or other activities:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="academic.activities" value="{{ academic.activities }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Favorite Subject:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="academic.favorite_subject" value="{{ academic.favorite_subject }}">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Personal Interests</div>
  <div class="content-block">
    <p>Please attach a personal essay that addresses all of the questions and statements below in a total of up to 1000 words.</p>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>High School Experience:</strong> Briefly describe your recent educational experience including involvement in school. What were your most difficult challenges? How did you address these challenges? List specific school activities you were involved in, sports, and organizations. Describe your motivation for participation in these.</li>
      <li><strong>Future Goals:</strong> Describe your future goals including college, career aspirations, and other things you hope to achieve in the next 3-5 years. Explain how you think a college education and a degree will help you achieve these goals.</li>
      <li><strong>Maturity and Character:</strong> Explain why you are a good candidate to participate in the Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program. What do you consider to be your strengths? What personal values, talents and gifts do you feel you have that will help you to succeed?</li>
      <li><strong>Leadership and Citizenship:</strong> Describe ways you have demonstrated good citizenship and leadership in your school and community?</li>
      <li><strong>Additional Comments:</strong> Include anything else you would like the selection committee to know about you for this application.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>Completed applications must include the essay plus two written recommendations as support for your participation. One recommendation should be from a school teacher or agency representative. The second recommendation should be completed by another responsible adult of your choice. Incomplete applications will not be considered.</p>
    <p>My signature below certifies that the information I have provided, on and attached to this application, is true and correct. I understand that if, at any time, any of the information provided is found to be false, any scholarship funds I have received based on this information will be rescinded possibly creating a balance due to Cleveland State University that I will be responsible for paying. In addition, I do hereby consent to the release of information concerning my academic and financial status to University Foundation, scholarship donors and the Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program Selection Committee.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div>
      <p>Signature:</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Date:</p>
      <div class="signature-line" style="width: 100px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">Cleveland State University</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">engagedlearning</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program Recommendation Form</div>

  <div class="form-grid">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Student Name:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="recommendation.student_name" value="{{ recommendation.student_name }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Phone Number:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="recommendation.phone_number" value="{{ recommendation.phone_number }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>School currently attending and School District:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="recommendation.school_district" value="{{ recommendation.school_district }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Please Print:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="recommendation.recommender_name" value="{{ recommendation.recommender_name }}">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p>I support the application of <span data-field="recommendation.student_name">{{ recommendation.student_name }}</span> for the Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program.</p>
    <p>Name of individual completing the recommendation form:</p>
    <p><input type="text" data-field="recommendation.recommender_name" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;" value="{{ recommendation.recommender_name }}"></p>
    <p>Relationship to the student applicant:</p>
    <p><input type="text" data-field="recommendation.relationship" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;" value="{{ recommendation.relationship }}"></p>
    <p>How long have you known the student applicant?</p>
    <p><input type="text" data-field="recommendation.duration" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;" value="{{ recommendation.duration }}"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p>What do you consider to be this student's two greatest strengths?</p>
    <ol>
      <li><input type="text" data-field="recommendation.strength_1" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 90%; margin-bottom: 10px;" value="{{ recommendation.strength_1 }}"></li>
      <li><input type="text" data-field="recommendation.strength_2" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 90%; margin-bottom: 10px;" value="{{ recommendation.strength_2 }}"></li>
    </ol>
    <p>What other attributes does this student possess that make you want to recommend her/him?</p>
    <div class="content-block" style="height: 100px; border: 1px solid #000; padding: 10px; margin-top: 5px;">
      <textarea data-field="recommendation.additional_comments" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; resize: none;">{{ recommendation.additional_comments }}</textarea>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div>
      <p>Signature of individual making recommendation:</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Title:</p>
      <div class="signature-line" style="width: 40%;"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Contact information:</p>
      <div class="signature-line" style="width: 40%;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note" style="margin-top: 60px;">
    Please return form to: Coordinator-Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program - Office of Inclusion and Multicultural Engagement Cleveland State University – <span data-field="address_footer">{{ address_footer }}</span> – Telephone: <span data-field="phone_footer">{{ phone_footer }}</span>.
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-logo">
    <!-- Placeholder for University Logo -->
    <div style="font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold;">Cleveland State University</div>
    <div style="font-size: 10pt;">engagedlearning</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program Precollege Scholarship Academic Release Form</div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <p>Applicants must obtain a copy of school transcript(s) or report card(s) for the full year of their last completed grade and submit it along with this Academic Release Form.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>To be completed by guardian or legal agent:</p>
    <p>I, <input type="text" data-field="guardian.name" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;" value="{{ guardian.name }}"> (Guardian/Legal agent's name), give my permission to <input type="text" data-field="school_name_releasing" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;" value="{{ school_name_releasing }}"> (Name of school releasing records) and authorize the release of the academic records of <input type="text" data-field="applicant_name_release" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;" value="{{ applicant_name_release }}"> (Applicant's name) to be used in the selection process of the Cleveland State University, Sullivan-Deckard Scholars Opportunity Program application for program participation and scholarship competition. I confirm that at the time this application is being submitted, the applicant is currently in <span data-field="grade_level">{{ grade_level }}</span> grade and positioned to graduate no later than <span data-field="graduation_date_release">{{ graduation_date_release }}</span>.</p>
    <p>I understand that the transcript and the entire nomination packet will become the property of Cleveland State University and will not be returned.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div>
      <p>Signature of Student Applicant:</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Date:</p>
      <div class="signature-line" style="width: 100px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>Signature of guardian or legal agent:</p>
      <div class="signature-line"></div>
      <p>Date:</p>
      <div class="signature-line" style="width: 100px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-grid" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Title:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="guardian.title" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;" value="{{ guardian.title }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row">
      <label>Telephone:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="guardian.phone" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 50%;" value="{{ guardian.phone }}">
    </div>
    <div class="form-row" style="grid-column: 1 / span 2;">
      <label>Address or Agency:</label>
      <input type="text" data-field="guardian.address" style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; width: 95%;" value="{{ guardian.address }}">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-note" style="margin-top: 60px;">
    Program and Scholarship Application Deadline: <span data-field="final_deadline_date">{{ final_deadline_date }}</span>. The competitive selection process requires completed application, personal statement, and personal interview. Call <span data-field="final_phone">{{ final_phone }}</span> or email <span data-field="final_email">{{ final_email }}</span>.
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>